# Wardogs / Pragma game backend — login and matchmaking, through the tunnel.
# Measured 2026-09-12: the game client's own TLS ClientHello to these hosts gets no ServerHello at
# all, and no desync opens it — the strategy's games profile (multisplit pos=1,midsld) carries curl
# to a 404 but not the client itself. The tunnel is the only thing that logs you in.
# Gameplay is NOT here: that is UDP to bare IPs, it has no hostname to match, and zapret2's games
# profile handles it directly — routing it through a node would only add latency.
pragmaengine.com
